<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia sugar beet output 300,000 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Tunisia sugar beet output 300,000 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's sugar beet harvest in 1996 was 300,000 tonnes, up by 19 percent from 234,400 tonnes in 1995, Agriculture Ministry sources said on Friday.</p>
<p>White sugar production in 1995 was 26,500 tonnes and represented 11.2 percent of the country's consumption.</p>
<p>Tunisia in 1995 imported 187,400 tonnes of sugar worth 68.7 million dinars, Central Bank figures showed. ($=0.98 dinar)</p>
</text>
